{"id":"5518caddec83ace1","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-glp-logic.md","title":"The Polymodal Logic GLP","display":"df-glp-logic — The Polymodal Logic GLP","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-glp-logic","aliases":["89-df-glp-logic"],"display":"df-glp-logic — The Polymodal Logic GLP","depends_on":["[[89-df-polymodal-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-glp-logic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-glp-logic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-glp-logic — The Polymodal Logic GLP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6866169a02ae8da\" href=\"?note=d6866169a02ae8da\" title=\"89-df-polymodal-formula\">89-df-polymodal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\)</span>；命题重言式以本语言的字母与盒公式为原子，用下式布尔递归定义。公理集与定理集不预先假设存在，均由所列集合构造。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glp\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_{P}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{[n]A\\mid n\\in\\omega,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&amp;\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_{P}),\\quad v_e(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\nv_e(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad v_e(A\\land B)\\coloneqq v_e(A)v_e(B),\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{P}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_{P}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\nE_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_P\n\\cup\\{[n](A\\to B)\\to([n]A\\to[n]B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P,n\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{[n]([n]A\\to A)\\to[n]A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P,n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{[n]A\\to[n+1]A,\\ \\neg[n]A\\to[n+1]\\neg[n]A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P,n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GLP}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\mid E_P\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\n\\forall A\\in X\\ ([0]A\\in X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glp\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_{P}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{[n]A\\mid n\\in\\omega,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&amp;\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_{P}),\\quad v_e(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\nv_e(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad v_e(A\\land B)\\coloneqq v_e(A)v_e(B),\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{P}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_{P}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\nE_P&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_P\n\\cup\\{[n](A\\to B)\\to([n]A\\to[n]B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P,n\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{[n]([n]A\\to A)\\to[n]A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P,n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{[n]A\\to[n+1]A,\\ \\neg[n]A\\to[n+1]\\neg[n]A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P,n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GLP}&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\mid E_P\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\n\\forall A\\in X\\ ([0]A\\in X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章 p.207，GLP。印刷页 p 对应 PDF 第 p+39 页。</p>\n<p>公式全集是闭包候选，故交集非空；全部模式与有限规则给出最小定理集。按原书采用相邻索引的两个交互模式和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0]\">\\([0]\\)</span> 必然化；其他索引必然化是派生规则。</p>\n<p>原书把盒解释为 PA、PA 加一次 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则、再加下一轮等可证性。本条只定义句法逻辑；这些高阶理论一般不能套用“任意可枚举理论的标准 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 证明谓词”。它们的迭代算术表示与完全性证明尚未在本目录展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-polymodal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d6866169a02ae8da","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-polymodal-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}glp\\text{-}logic}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{At}_{P}&\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Prop}\\cup\\{[n]A\\mid n\\in\\omega,A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\},\\\\\nv_e(C)&\\coloneqq e(C)\\ (C\\in\\mathsf{At}_{P}),\\quad v_e(\\bot)\\coloneqq0,\\\\\nv_e(\\neg A)&\\coloneqq1-v_e(A),\\quad v_e(A\\land B)\\coloneqq v_e(A)v_e(B),\\\\\n\\mathcal T_{P}&\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\mid\\forall e:\\mathsf{At}_{P}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ v_e(A)=1\\},\\\\\n\nE_P&\\coloneqq\\mathcal T_P\n\\cup\\{[n](A\\to B)\\to([n]A\\to[n]B)\\mid A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P,n\\in\\omega\\}\\\\\n&\\quad\\cup\\{[n]([n]A\\to A)\\to[n]A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P,n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\cup\\{[n]A\\to[n+1]A,\\ \\neg[n]A\\to[n+1]\\neg[n]A\\mid A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P,n\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{GLP}&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P\\mid E_P\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&\\qquad\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_P((A\\in X\\land(A\\to B)\\in X)\\to B\\in X),\\\n\\forall A\\in X\\ ([0]A\\in X)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"[0]","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":2013,"backlinks":[{"id":"e07090c199ebf13e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"111bbf1b6bb9102a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLP}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_P$ 是 [[89-df-glp-logic]] 定义的定理集。"},{"id":"cc787cdf3049271e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GLB}$ 与 $\\mathrm{GLP}$ 分别取 [[89-df-glb-logic]]、[[89-df-glp-logic]] 的定理集。"},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-glp-logic]]、[[89-df-glsp-logic]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"GLP（p.207）：[[89-df-polymodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glp-logic]] → [[89-df-glsp-logic]] → [[89-lem-glp-finite-support]]；与 GLB 的连接见 [[89-prop-glb-glp-embedding]]。"}],"outgoing":["d6866169a02ae8da"]}